- **Sustained Speed**: Continue accelerating until the car reaches a higher velocity threshold (1.0 m/s) to ensure it has enough speed to overcome the hill.
- **Maintain Speed**: Once the car reaches a high velocity, maintain it to avoid unnecessary deceleration.

